  <!--
    A trimmed copy of the shape OFAC publishes, not of its contents. The addresses
    below are synthetic: this fixture exists to prove the parser still reads the
    format, and a fake address cannot be mistaken for a designation Vigil asserts.
    The real document is 29 MB and does not belong in a repository.
  -->

